id: pm-ado-release-gate
title: Release readiness behind PM_RELEASE_APPROVED
description: "Prepare daily OIDC publishing behind one repository approval variable. Verify metadata, allowlisted packed files, privacy, regression checks, npm and Bun release gates. The owner performs the first npm publish and trusted-publisher setup; keep approval unset."
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-25T23:20:34.886Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-25T23:31:51.066Z"
author: codex-agent
comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-25T23:20:38.141Z",codex-agent,"Normalize daily scheduling and PM_RELEASE_APPROVED job gates while preserving release decisions, generated changelogs and release notes. Verify OIDC publishing without a stored npm token, manifest metadata, packed allowlists and private-data scans. No open homepage/author PR was found during orientation. No publishing, trust setup, approval variable changes or merges are authorized."
  "2026-10-25T23:24:23.992Z",codex-agent,"Pack verification: npm pack --dry-run --json and the actual npm pack --ignore-scripts artifact agree on 30 allowlisted files (dist: 20; docs: 5; root files: 5). Every packed member was scanned for absolute home paths, npm/GitHub/cloud tokens, private keys, hosted-data locations, private addresses and historical owner email addresses: PASS with zero matches. Regression proof: five independent workflow mutations (approval, provenance, token environment, daily schedule and OR bypass) plus the original manifest each fail the new contract check; restored contract passes 4/4. The linked test also passes through pm test --run --progress. Next gates: npm run release:check and bun run release:check with isolated HOME and Git configuration."
  "2026-10-25T23:31:48.540Z",codex-agent,"Full local gates PASS: npm run release:check and bun run release:check, each with isolated HOME, GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null and GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1. Suite receipts: npm: 1/1/230/1/1/230 tests; bun: 1/1/230/1/1/230 tests. No thresholds were relaxed. The package remains unpublished and the approval variable unset; first publication requires the owner login and initial trusted-publisher registration. For the local first publish, explicitly override provenance with --provenance=false because publishConfig enables provenance for cloud CI. CI must confirm the final PR head. The tracker item stays in progress for orchestrator verification."
